      "updated": 1791920639487,
      "created": 1791920468621,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "130 samples --> preductions from base model\n\nerror is known for initial 130 samples\n\nuse that error to train the base model\n\nuse that afapted version to get predictions on the next 130 samples\n\nerror on the 131:260\n\nagain retrain the adapter to further adapt\n\nfinal 130 samples is out of sample ...\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "130 samples --> preductions from base model\n\nerror is known for initial 130 samples\n\nuse that error to train the base model\n\nuse that afapted version to get predictions on the next 130 samples\n\nerror on the 131:260\n\nagain retrain the adapter to further adapt\n\nfinal 130 samples is out of sample ...\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
